WEBVTT

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.110
“If you are...”

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:21.990
“If you are...”

00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:27.870
“A pirate among pirates
among other pirates and pirates...”

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:31.960
“Bring your
trusted friends to this island.”

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:37.010
“The name of the island is...”

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.430
Omatsuri Island?

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.810
Yes. Omatsuri Island.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:46.390
I've never heard of it.

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:47.980
It's a trap. I'm sure of it.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.400
What kind of place is Omatsuri Island?
Are they having a festival or something?

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:52.770
I'll read on.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:57.190
“Omatsuri Island is the Grand Line's
only resort island of your dreams.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.280
As the name indicates,
every day is like a festival.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:01.850
Get yourselves soothed
at our many spas and aesthetic salons.”

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.830
Spas and aesthetic salons?!

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.540
Where?! It sounds like a nice place!

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:08.830
“At night, enjoy an amber-colour moment
with the world's most beautiful women.”

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:11.750
Beautiful women?!
It sounds like a great island!

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.670
“And for dinner,
a dream-come-true full course meal.”

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:15.920
Dream come true?!

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:18.210
What is it?! What kind
of food do they serve?!

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:20.170
- It must be a trap.
- What?! A trap?

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.100
Omatsuri Island sounds fine to me.

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:27.600
I'm cool with it. The name itself
sounds like it's a nice island! I guarantee it.

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:31.690
What are we gonna do, Captain?

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.270
Hey, Luffy...

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:38.600
Luffy! Are you listening?! Luffy!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:41.860
- Nami, read it from the beginning again.
- Hm? Oh...

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:48.200
“If you are a pirate among pirates
among other pirates and pirates,

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.660
bring your trusted friends to this island.”

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:54.000
Okay, I've made up my mind!
- So...?!

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:56.920
Let's go to this Omatsuri Island!

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:59.710
Because we are... Pirates!!

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:35.630
BARON OMATSURI
AND THE SECRET ISLAND

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:03.460
This REALLY is a festive island.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:08.380
Yaaaay!! We're here!!

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:13.430
Maybe the festival's finished.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:18.350
Have I, as the navigator,
ever taken us to the wrong destination?

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:25.990
So who wanted to take a
vacation on this deserted island?

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:35.070
It's ideal if you don't want
to see anyone during your holiday.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:37.210
Why can't he just shut up?

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:38.790
Huh? Did you say something?

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:39.960
This is odd...

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.960
- What is?
- Remember the flower on the map?

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:46.050
But there aren't any on this island.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:48.340
We were tricked.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:50.050
Come on, let's go back.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:55.060
- Hm? ...Do you hear that?
- Mm?

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.310
- That Way!
- Mm?

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.820
Spas and aesthetic salons.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:54.530
The most beautiful women in the world...

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.290
Dream-come-true dinner!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:01.790
This is...

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:03.920
Gonna be great...

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:13.800
There they are!
The amber-colour...beauties...

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:15.920
Hey!!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:18.390
Look!
They have leaves growing out of their heads!

00:06:18.570 --> 00:06:19.720
There too!

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:22.230
Here too!
What are these guys?!

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:41.790
Leaves and now a flower!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.370
Flower...

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:48.630
Pirates!

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.590
Oh, brave pirates that sail the Grand Line!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.380
- Ah! Yes! Yes! Yes!
- Luffy!

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:57.050
Welcome to Omatsuri Island!

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.890
My name is Baron Omatsuri!

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.890
Baron Omatsuri?!

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:04.600
Yes! I am the lord of
this island and your host.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:05.980
Here it comes!

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.740
You must be tired from your long journey.
I hope you enjoy your stay here.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.150
Here it comes!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:12.570
Be soothed and
pampered to your heart's desire!

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.450
Here it comes!!

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:18.950
But before that, I must have you

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.290
take the Trial of Hell!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.210
Trial of...
Hell?

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:25.580
- Trial...
- Of...

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.380
- Hell?
- I knew it!

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:30.920
Um... Uh... Question!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.260
What is it?

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:36.010
- It said spas and aesthetic salons...
- Spas?

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.640
The most beautiful women
in the world... amber colour...

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:39.760
Amber colour?

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.890
And dream-come-true dinners...?

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:44.600
Dream come true?

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:46.770
- Let's go.
- Wait, wait, wait!

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:49.650
Hey Mister, what's the Trial of Hell?

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.980
The Trial of Hell is a test of your strength.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:57.780
There are many who have failed
and fled with their tails between their legs.

00:07:58.580 --> 00:07:59.960
Wow! Sounds like fun!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:04.830
You should leave right now
if you don't believe in yourself and friends.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:08.170
Are you kidding me?! Of course we'll do it!

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:10.930
Luffy!

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.170
Luffy, think about it!

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:16.720
What good will it do us to take this test?!

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:19.720
Good or no good, we're not obliged to do it.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:21.550
That's right, Luffy! It's dangerous!

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:24.130
I know we don't have to, but I WANT to.

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:27.690
See? I told you, didn't I? It's a trap!

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:30.150
- You think so?
- It's the Trial of Hell, you know!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:32.570
- That's true.
- Who knows what'll happen.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:33.980
- I guess.
- Luffy!

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:35.400
What.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:40.380
Why aren't you ever scared of anything?

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:44.040
Because even if it's a trap,
you guys will be okay!

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:47.910
- What?
- And I have faith in you guys.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.040
You know the right things to say, Captain.

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:55.170
Hell... Hell, huh...

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:57.220
Let's see what it's like.

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:58.340
Zoro?!

00:08:58.440 --> 00:08:59.620
I'm in.

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:02.010
I'm a little curious about that baron.

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:03.220
Robin!

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:05.720
- Fine, then... Me too.
- What?

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:08.640
Well, I suppose...
But let's get it over with quickly.

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:12.060
Luffy, if you're so determined, I'm with you!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.900
H-Hey... All right! I'm in too.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.410
So everyone is participating. Very well!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.660
The Trial of Hell...! Prepare!

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:35.340
Wh-What's going on?!

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:44.100
All right! I will now announce
what you must do in this Trial of Hell!

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:46.260
- It is...!!
- It is?!

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:49.140
Catching goldfish!!

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:55.570
Catching goldfish...?!

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.440
Yes, catching goldfish! The rule is simple.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:03.700
The winner is the person
who catches the most goldfish in 3 minutes!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:07.030
For your information,
this paper net melts especially fast in water.

00:10:09.050 --> 00:10:13.290
And now, your opponent!
A man I am proud to introduce to you!

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:15.330
- Go, Muchigoro!
- Yes, sir!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:31.770
Hi! I'm Muchigoro!

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.730
- What's his name?
- Mutsugoro.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:37.100
You mean, an eel, right?

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:38.860
He could be a weather loach.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:39.980
He's probably just an idiot.

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:42.990
No!! My name is Muchigoro!!

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.950
Baron Omatsuri's
most trusted officer, Muchigoro!!

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.830
- I told you he's an idiot.
- So who will it be from your team?

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:53.620
Mm?! Yes! Yes! Yes! Me! Me! Me!

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:54.790
- Hold it!
- Huh?

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:59.630
I don't know whether he's Muchigoro
or Sujigoro or whatever, but leave it to me!

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.760
Excuse me... I thought you were
scared to death of doing the Trial of Hell?

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:05.840
He probably felt bolder
after he heard it was catching goldfish.

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:07.130
Yo Tamegoro!

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.550
It's MUCHIGORO!

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:11.210
You'll regret
that you had to fight against me!

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:16.480
People call me the master of goldfishing!
That's me!

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.440
- Master?! Master?!
- Master!!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:19.650
- Really?!
- Really?!

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:20.780
Yeah, really!

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.490
- Wow!
- You're amazing!

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:24.450
I am, aren't I?

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:25.730
You're not lying, are you?!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.870
Tell me it's a lie!

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:29.830
It's a lie.

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:31.540
- A lie?!
- It's a lie?!

00:11:31.630 --> 00:11:32.700
Yeah, a lie!

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:34.210
So you lied to us?!

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:35.710
Damn! You fooled us!

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.110
See? An idiot.

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.890
Muchigoro,
don't let them get to you like that!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.590
I'm sorry,
Baron, sir! Dammit!

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.880
Are you ready?

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.760
- Let the games
- Begin!

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:51.180
- Mm?
- What?

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.480
What?

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:04.890
- Wh...Wh...Wh...
- Wh--?!

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:07.280
What's that?!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.160
Rosario, my lovely pet goldfish.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.130
Did you see that?! Laugh, Muchigoro!

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:22.170
They're cowards!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:27.130
My Rosario is a good girl.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.510
Hey! What is this?!

00:12:31.610 --> 00:12:34.310
Mm? Like I said, catching goldfish.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.520
How are we supposed to catch THAT?!

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:39.940
Oh, after you catch it, put it in that bucket.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.110
He's not listening.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:42.610
He fooled us!

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.570
I'm starting to enjoy this!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:47.740
I'm not

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:48.860
- Pass!
- What?

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:51.120
You do it.

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:53.450
W-Wait a minute! YOU'RE the master, right?!

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:55.950
Ohh... Fine, I'll do it! I will!

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:05.550
I can't.

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:07.130
Nami-san! Watch out!

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.090
What?!

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:13.510
Rosario-chan!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.520
Nami-san... Did you see my kick?

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:20.650
- Zoro, here!
- What?

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:22.220
Me?!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:26.730
I have no choice, do I?

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:41.080
No swords!! It's against the rules!

00:13:44.100 --> 00:13:46.550
Right... Dammit!!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.050
A liner back to the mound!

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:52.970
Hey you!!
I bet you were gonna slice up my Rosario!

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:54.680
What else could I have gone?!

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:56.560
Let me try! Give me the net!

00:13:57.530 --> 00:14:01.350
Gum-Gum Pistol!!

00:14:01.490 --> 00:14:03.150
His arm's stretching!

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:05.020
The power of a Devil Fruit!

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.280
It ripped!!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.700
Ahhh!! It ripped!!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:17.200
You couldn't have caught that
goldfish with that net in the first place.

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:19.040
- You're absolutely right!
- What?!

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:20.710
Muchigoro, show it to them!

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:24.820
I'll show you how you catch Rosario-chan!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:27.960
- That's not fair!!
- You can't use that!

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.340
Nobody said you have to use this net.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:36.050
I just said it melts especially fast in water.
Now do you remember?

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:38.010
H-He tricked us again...

00:14:38.320 --> 00:14:39.430
One more minute!

00:14:39.530 --> 00:14:41.850
Only one more minute!

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:45.530
Rosario-chan,
be a good girl and fall into this!

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:01.000
Good job, Muchigoro!

00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:02.830
Thank you, Sir Baron!

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:07.890
I see. Anything goes then, right?

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:12.010
There!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.470
Another Devil Fruit eater!

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.730
Rosario-chan...

00:15:22.820 --> 00:15:26.680
Oh my God!
It's coming this way! Run!!

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:29.860
- Chopper!!
- Let me handle this!

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:38.660
Ten more seconds!!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:43.190
Nine, eight, seven, six, five, four

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:46.920
three, two,

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:48.080
one

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:55.540
Game over! Game over!

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:59.220
The Straw Hat Team's victory! Victory!

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.260
- Yes!!
- All right!!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:02.810
You did it, Chopper!

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:09.390
- Chopper?!
- Hm?

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:14.490
Chopper!!

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.430
Luffy...

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:40.220
Chopper! Hold on! I'm gonna help you!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.550
I thought I was gonna die...

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:18.090
Thanks, Luffy.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.300
It's okay... No problem.

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:21.760
Hey! I'm the one who saved you guys.

00:17:21.860 --> 00:17:23.720
Since when were you in the water?

00:17:24.070 --> 00:17:28.600
When will you learn that
you'll never be able to swim, you idiots?!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:35.270
Anyway, you guys! We...!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:37.740
Yes, yes! Won!!

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:39.400
We won!! Yes!!

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:44.330
I'm so sorry, Sir Baron! I'm so ashamed!

00:17:44.420 --> 00:17:48.160
I have disgraced you

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:50.080
It was kind of an easy win.

00:17:50.180 --> 00:17:53.330
The Trial of Hell? Yeah, whatever!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:56.800
Congratulations!
Congratulations! Congratulations!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:02.260
Just a minute! You guys have not won yet!!

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:04.930
Huh? We just did.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.140
You will go through another trial!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:08.680
I will not let it end like this!

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:12.190
You insulted my Muchigoro!
You won't get away with it!

00:18:12.280 --> 00:18:14.060
Hey, Mister!
You never told us about another one!

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.570
A loss is a loss. Accept it gracefully.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:19.150
Shut up! That's enough talk!
I said another one, and that's that!

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:20.700
What's wrong with this guy?

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:23.110
You're being a bad loser.

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:25.770
Another trial, huh?! It sounds like fun!

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:28.700
- What?!
- Let's do another one!

00:18:28.800 --> 00:18:32.170
Luffy! Luffy! We came to a resort!

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:34.670
Not to a training camp! Do you understand?!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.380
Okay, you guys! Let's win the next one too!

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:38.960
Listen to me, you idiot!

00:18:39.060 --> 00:18:41.130
I'm won't accept a defeat!

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:43.260
- Listen to me, you idiot!
- Nami, you too!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.050
Listen to me, you idiot!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:59.820
Nami! Where are you going?!

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.740
If you like the Trial of Hell that much,
then you do it alone!

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:03.950
I'm out of here.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:06.790
Come on, Nami! Nami!!

00:19:07.920 --> 00:19:09.490
Hm? What?
So where are we?

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.040
- Are we lost?
- What?!

00:19:11.970 --> 00:19:13.500
Then where's our ship...?

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:15.330
We don't know that either!

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:18.250
- Maybe it's this way.
- What?

00:19:18.350 --> 00:19:19.800
No, it's this way.

00:19:19.890 --> 00:19:21.710
Hold on! Let's calm down.

00:19:21.810 --> 00:19:24.930
Give me the map. Um... Where are we now?

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:26.430
I don't know.

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:29.190
So what's the use of having a map?!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.020
Hm? What's that?

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:33.060
Obviously, someone was having a picnic.

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:34.190
Here on this island?

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:36.310
Some people are just plain weird.

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:37.980
Just leave it there.

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.260
Let's keep going.

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:41.440
Yeah. We have to find the beach first.

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:43.360
We'll come out somewhere.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:45.280
Hey... Nami...
Let's go back!

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:47.240
- Shut up!
- Nami!

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.160
I said shut up!

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:51.290
Look! The forest is clearing. Hm?

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.790
I've been waiting for you, brave pirates!

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:59.750
Yo! Flower Man!!

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:01.040
Wh-Why...?

00:20:01.140 --> 00:20:02.590
We can't enjoy a vacation.

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.510
We can't get off this island.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.220
So, what's our other choice?

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:07.430
Trial of Hell!

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.550
Part 2!

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:17.690
Ladies and gentlemen,
I will now announce the next trial!

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:19.810
- It is...!
- It is?!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:21.860
Ring toss!

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:24.930
Ring toss?!

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:28.570
The game will be played
on boats by four people from each team.

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:31.870
The winner is the person who tosses a ring
around every member of the opponent team!

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:35.450
And now, I am proud to
introduce to you my four wise men!

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.580
Kerojee, the leader of the team!

00:20:39.680 --> 00:20:42.300
Keroshot, the key offensive player!

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:46.010
Kerodehku, the repairman!

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:50.930
Keroko, the youngest
and the only woman on the team!

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:55.390
What? Is he serious? They're all so old.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:59.150
"To us up here, you all are
nothing but runny-nosed greenhorns."

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:01.110
Runny-nosed?! I can't believe you'd say that!

00:21:01.200 --> 00:21:02.770
And why are you talking like that?

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:05.690
"She is angry,
that girl's short-tempered, very immature."

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:08.650
So what if I'm short-tempered!
It's me! And WHY are you talking like that?!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:12.070
Phew, oh boy,
I'm very tired, may I go to sleep?

00:21:12.170 --> 00:21:13.700
Don't go to sleep! You're pissing me off!

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:17.210
"How very insolent, just because
you're a little bit younger than me."

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:19.540
Not a little bit! A lot younger! A lot!

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:21.250
So, who will play on your team?

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:22.960
Me, me, me, me!

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:25.250
No! Let me handle this!

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:28.510
They talked Nami into playing
without making her realize it.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:31.140
If Nami-san's gonna play, maybe I will too.

00:21:31.230 --> 00:21:32.760
Oh... Robin-chan, how about you?

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:34.470
You're always like that.

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:36.520
I'm not talking to you!

00:21:36.610 --> 00:21:38.270
I wouldn't even if you were.

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:39.890
Amateurs can watch on the sideline.

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:41.690
Who are you talking about?!

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:44.020
Who else would I be talking about?!

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:45.570
Now, now, now, now...

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:46.690
4,3

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:47.820
3,2

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:49.110
2,1

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:49.900
ON YOUR MARK, GET SET

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:20.730
A town?!

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:24.520
Look at that! They're so slow!

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:35.950
Huh?! Nami, now!

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:37.370
I know!

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:42.800
No way!

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:44.040
They' re fast!

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:46.810
"Here we go,
can we start attacking you very soon?"

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:57.560
They overtook us.

00:22:57.650 --> 00:22:58.810
They sure did.

00:23:01.030 --> 00:23:03.020
What's up with those guys...?

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:07.190
Good! We passed them! Get the rings out!

00:23:07.410 --> 00:23:08.980
There's something that's annoying me.

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:10.110
Huh?!

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:14.530
Why is someone with a stick hanging down
by his side on this boat and not Nami-san?

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:16.740
Shall we do it now?

00:23:16.840 --> 00:23:17.870
All right!

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:26.630
Why am I not with Nami-san...?

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:33.100
I wanted to play the ring toss...

00:23:33.180 --> 00:23:36.180
Let them handle it.
We'll relax and enjoy ourselves.

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:51.970
Mm? What? Huh?!

00:23:57.790 --> 00:23:59.660
Hmm?! What? What?

00:24:01.090 --> 00:24:02.360
Who's there?!

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:07.580
Where are you?!
Stop hiding and come out!

00:24:12.220 --> 00:24:13.410
There!!

00:24:14.020 --> 00:24:15.420
Stop!

00:24:16.690 --> 00:24:19.220
Stop!

00:24:19.360 --> 00:24:21.220
Hey!!

00:24:21.320 --> 00:24:23.430
I said stop!!

00:24:27.950 --> 00:24:29.480
Let's get our act together

00:24:29.570 --> 00:24:30.610
and pass them!

00:24:30.700 --> 00:24:31.940
Prepare to attack!

00:24:32.040 --> 00:24:33.440
Prepare to attack!

00:24:33.700 --> 00:24:35.900
Attack!

00:24:42.630 --> 00:24:44.580
I can't see the front!

00:24:47.130 --> 00:24:48.750
Dammit! I'm hungry!

00:24:48.840 --> 00:24:50.080
Which is it!?

00:24:52.180 --> 00:24:54.550
It's not smoky if we go in front of you!

00:24:54.640 --> 00:24:57.340
- Hey! Eat like an old person, will you?!
- Meat! Meat! Meat! Meat!

00:24:57.770 --> 00:25:00.090
THESE are for you guys!

00:25:01.980 --> 00:25:03.360
What is this?!

00:25:07.070 --> 00:25:08.140
Fire!!

00:25:17.750 --> 00:25:19.570
So, how do you like this place?

00:25:19.920 --> 00:25:23.620
Enjoy yourselves until the game is over.

00:25:26.670 --> 00:25:27.750
Thanks...

00:25:37.850 --> 00:25:39.090
How nice of you.

00:25:39.190 --> 00:25:44.810
You beat me in the game.
Sol have to obey your orders.

00:25:44.900 --> 00:25:47.180
That's the rule on this island.

00:25:47.280 --> 00:25:50.100
I see. Then let's have a drink.

00:25:50.200 --> 00:25:52.230
I'm still on duty so...

00:25:52.320 --> 00:25:55.530
But you said you have to obey me.

00:25:55.620 --> 00:25:58.150
All right then.

00:25:58.250 --> 00:26:00.700
To this rather strange resort.

00:26:00.790 --> 00:26:02.200
Cheers.

00:26:04.210 --> 00:26:06.120
But it's a really EMPTY resort.

00:26:06.210 --> 00:26:08.330
We're the only ones here.

00:26:08.840 --> 00:26:09.910
Doctor?

00:26:11.260 --> 00:26:14.250
I'm gonna go explore this place.
I'll be right back.

00:26:51.050 --> 00:26:53.250
Mmm... What do you want with me?

00:26:53.550 --> 00:26:55.330
- Thank you for asking!
- What?

00:26:55.550 --> 00:27:01.170
Despite the grave danger, I've come to
this mansion to make a splendid proposal.

00:27:01.270 --> 00:27:02.430
Grave danger?

00:27:02.560 --> 00:27:06.050
Let me introduce myself.
l am Brief, captain of the Chobihigé Pirates.

00:27:06.150 --> 00:27:10.310
I am a brave man who started a protest
against Baron Omatsuri domination.

00:27:10.440 --> 00:27:13.230
Hey! You have a booger under your nose.

00:27:13.320 --> 00:27:14.590
This is a moustache!

00:27:14.700 --> 00:27:16.980
The symbol of the Chobihigé Pirates!

00:27:17.080 --> 00:27:19.740
For your information,
we have a special way of greeting each other.

00:27:19.830 --> 00:27:20.990
It goes like this. Chobihigé!

00:27:24.330 --> 00:27:28.330
Isn't it cool?
You try it too! Chobihigé!

00:27:30.090 --> 00:27:32.250
What's wrong?
You just go like this. Chobihigé!

00:27:32.340 --> 00:27:34.000
What's your proposal?

00:27:34.180 --> 00:27:35.670
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:27:36.010 --> 00:27:38.630
- You have six friends with you.
- What?

00:27:38.720 --> 00:27:41.010
I saw you. A very good team indeed.

00:27:41.100 --> 00:27:43.260
- We are.
- Wonderful friends.

00:27:43.350 --> 00:27:45.510
- Of course.
- Great teamwork.

00:27:45.650 --> 00:27:46.830
Tell me about it!

00:27:46.940 --> 00:27:51.970
- And so... Listen carefully.
- Why don't you guys join my team? -Huh?

00:27:53.240 --> 00:27:56.440
Why don't you all
become a Chobihigé Pirate?

00:28:02.500 --> 00:28:04.610
Hey, were you listening?

00:28:04.710 --> 00:28:08.870
I'll say it again.
Why don't you all become a...!

00:28:11.840 --> 00:28:13.210
No violence, please!

00:28:13.760 --> 00:28:17.380
No! Of course we won't join your team!

00:28:17.840 --> 00:28:19.670
That's what everyone says at first.

00:28:19.760 --> 00:28:23.130
But after you spend some time on this island,
you'll change your mind.

00:28:23.220 --> 00:28:24.670
- Let me warn you...
- Huh?

00:28:25.480 --> 00:28:27.720
Beware of Baron Omatsuri.

00:28:27.810 --> 00:28:30.680
He destroys friendship.

00:29:13.530 --> 00:29:14.710
Flowers...

00:29:44.100 --> 00:29:45.170
Wh-Who are you?!

00:29:45.270 --> 00:29:46.340
Me?

00:29:47.640 --> 00:29:48.910
What are you doing?! Stop!

00:29:49.020 --> 00:29:52.140
You work for Baron Omatsuri!
You'll pay for what you did earlier!

00:29:52.230 --> 00:29:55.470
Surrender! There! There! There!

00:29:55.570 --> 00:29:58.050
Do you give up, Otter Monster?!

00:29:58.150 --> 00:30:00.020
There! There! There!

00:30:00.110 --> 00:30:01.190
I'm not an otter!

00:30:03.120 --> 00:30:05.360
- Daddy!
- Daddy?

00:30:05.450 --> 00:30:08.240
You guys stay right there!
Daddy's not gonna lose!

00:30:08.910 --> 00:30:12.160
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I won't do it again! Forgive me!

00:30:12.250 --> 00:30:16.450
- Who are you guys? I'm not one of Baron Omatsuri's men.
-Huh?!

00:30:17.260 --> 00:30:18.910
Then, are you maybe a pirate?

00:30:22.890 --> 00:30:26.960
What a coincidence. We're pirates too.

00:30:27.060 --> 00:30:32.260
But we're a small-time,
family-run crew called the Ochanoma Pirates.

00:30:32.560 --> 00:30:34.850
Oh... They're
my daughters and son over there.

00:30:34.980 --> 00:30:36.640
They're adorable.

00:30:36.780 --> 00:30:39.640
They're all such daddy's kids.

00:30:40.280 --> 00:30:43.940
We heard that this place was a resort,
so we came here for a picnic.

00:30:44.030 --> 00:30:46.020
But it was all a hoax.

00:30:46.120 --> 00:30:49.320
How am I supposed to
catch that gigantic goldfish?

00:30:49.410 --> 00:30:51.240
- So?
- I fled.

00:30:51.330 --> 00:30:56.330
But my kids still believe
that their daddy is really strong.

00:30:57.420 --> 00:31:02.660
Oh... I see you're
a reasonable guy, so I ask you...

00:31:04.590 --> 00:31:07.710
- Let me clobber you in front of my kids?
- What?!

00:31:08.260 --> 00:31:09.590
- Just pretend!
- But...

00:31:09.680 --> 00:31:12.930
Please! In return, I'll tell you
all the secrets of this island!

00:31:13.020 --> 00:31:15.180
- Secrets?
- Yes. Secrets.

00:31:17.230 --> 00:31:19.390
We'll just pretend, okay? Please?

00:31:19.610 --> 00:31:22.170
Surrender!!

00:31:23.530 --> 00:31:25.020
Forgive me!

00:31:28.950 --> 00:31:31.110
HEY!!!

00:31:31.200 --> 00:31:32.390
I give up!

00:31:32.540 --> 00:31:34.530
Wow! Daddy, you're so strong!

00:31:34.620 --> 00:31:35.900
Strong! Strong! Strong!

00:31:36.000 --> 00:31:37.990
That's right! Daddy IS strong!!

00:31:38.250 --> 00:31:40.700
Really...? That was real phony...

00:31:40.800 --> 00:31:42.870
What do you mean?! Of course it's true!

00:31:42.970 --> 00:31:45.830
Listen. Don't believe this man, okay?

00:31:46.260 --> 00:31:48.210
Don't call your father “this man“!

00:31:48.300 --> 00:31:49.710
Shut up, geezer!

00:31:49.810 --> 00:31:51.710
Geezer?! You call me “Daddy“!

00:31:51.810 --> 00:31:54.130
- Fool!
- Fool?

00:32:00.570 --> 00:32:01.940
Yes! We caught up!

00:32:05.700 --> 00:32:07.020
What is that?!

00:32:15.620 --> 00:32:17.740
Now it's our turn to attack!
Yo! Move closer!

00:32:18.290 --> 00:32:20.330
Shut up! I know!

00:32:21.920 --> 00:32:23.580
I'm gonna get you!

00:32:23.670 --> 00:32:24.710
Damn!

00:32:29.010 --> 00:32:30.200
Dodge the bullets, will you?!

00:32:30.310 --> 00:32:32.300
How do you expect me to do that?!

00:32:32.600 --> 00:32:34.380
Hey! Wait! Stop!

00:32:48.700 --> 00:32:50.440
I said dodge the bullets!!

00:32:50.530 --> 00:32:52.110
- YOU dodge them!
- Impressive.

00:32:52.200 --> 00:32:54.610
- Impressive.
- Stay alert!

00:32:55.870 --> 00:32:57.320
Dammit!

00:32:59.000 --> 00:33:00.160
What?!

00:33:02.750 --> 00:33:04.870
Watch where you're going, you idiot!

00:33:04.960 --> 00:33:06.210
Then YOU steer!

00:33:06.300 --> 00:33:08.750
I was doing it before! In fact, you...

00:33:08.840 --> 00:33:10.590
In fact what?! Green Tea Head!

00:33:10.970 --> 00:33:14.210
G-Green tea head?! Dammit!
You... You Question Mark!!

00:33:14.310 --> 00:33:16.010
Question Mark?!
What are you talking about?!

00:33:16.100 --> 00:33:19.430
Your eyebrows! Do you have
a question for me, you Question Mark?!

00:33:19.980 --> 00:33:21.720
Hot! Hot! Hot!

00:33:22.190 --> 00:33:25.730
"Hot, hot, hot,
that's how it's best, charcoal grill."

00:33:25.820 --> 00:33:27.890
Usopp! Do something!
Can't you think of anything?!

00:33:28.360 --> 00:33:31.230
"That's what you say, but we can't
extinguish the fire, not right now"

00:33:31.320 --> 00:33:33.270
Why are YOU talking
like that now?! You piss me off

00:33:33.370 --> 00:33:34.740
- "A good idea!"
- Good idea?!

00:33:34.830 --> 00:33:37.200
"Almost have one but then again not"

00:33:37.290 --> 00:33:39.910
You...! You're so useless!

00:33:43.040 --> 00:33:44.420
R-Rescue box?

00:33:44.500 --> 00:33:45.690
Hey, there's another one.

00:33:45.800 --> 00:33:48.790
You open that
when you're in trouble. It's a lucky...

00:33:48.880 --> 00:33:49.960
Hey! Shhh! Ohhh!

00:33:50.090 --> 00:33:53.460
I get it!
There's a comeback item inside, right?

00:33:55.350 --> 00:33:58.840
What's inside?! What's inside?!

00:33:59.350 --> 00:34:01.590
You win a pair of matching cups!

00:34:04.320 --> 00:34:06.520
What good will these do right now...?

00:34:06.860 --> 00:34:08.730
I use them like this, right?!

00:34:10.570 --> 00:34:12.940
Then what's in this one?

00:34:14.200 --> 00:34:16.680
What? What?! Oh my God!

00:34:18.160 --> 00:34:19.280
Usopp

00:34:21.960 --> 00:34:24.740
H-Hey!! Where are you going?! Usopp!

00:34:25.040 --> 00:34:26.080
Uso...!!

00:34:26.170 --> 00:34:29.870
He's fleeing! Fleeing!
Fleeing by himself! Kero kero kero...

00:34:30.220 --> 00:34:36.630
"More than friends, the self is more precious,
that's human nature." Very weak...

00:34:36.770 --> 00:34:38.590
Kero kero kero kero!!

00:34:52.030 --> 00:34:54.060
This is great!

00:35:05.340 --> 00:35:07.790
- Flower?
- Yes. A flower.

00:35:07.880 --> 00:35:12.710
No, I don't know any flower
that only grows on this island...

00:35:12.800 --> 00:35:16.540
Anyway, I'm drunk and I'm getting sleepy...

00:35:16.640 --> 00:35:19.630
Come on, try to remember.

00:35:19.810 --> 00:35:22.180
Now that I think about it...

00:35:22.390 --> 00:35:23.430
Now that you think about it...

00:35:24.020 --> 00:35:26.690
L-Lily... Carnation...

00:35:26.770 --> 00:35:28.760
Lily? What is it?

00:35:28.860 --> 00:35:31.100
It grows on top of the mountain...

00:35:47.880 --> 00:35:49.790
Lily... Carnation...

00:35:49.960 --> 00:35:51.290
Hey!! You!!

00:35:51.380 --> 00:35:52.460
Wait!!

00:35:52.550 --> 00:35:54.750
I can't tolerate this any longer.

00:35:54.840 --> 00:35:56.830
Don't overdo it, Green Tea Head.

00:35:56.930 --> 00:35:59.460
That's exactly how I feel, Question Mark.

00:35:59.560 --> 00:36:02.550
You!! Don't ignore us!!

00:36:11.030 --> 00:36:13.390
Hey, hey, hey!! I bet you're scared NOW!

00:36:13.490 --> 00:36:15.730
Will you just shut up?!

00:36:18.120 --> 00:36:19.730
- I'm ready now.
- All right.

00:36:20.290 --> 00:36:21.780
Sorry! They broke our boat!

00:36:21.870 --> 00:36:22.900
Don't worry about it!

00:36:23.000 --> 00:36:25.820
Repair complete! We have more power now.

00:36:31.920 --> 00:36:33.910
Doctor?

00:36:35.430 --> 00:36:36.750
Okay, let's continue.

00:36:36.840 --> 00:36:37.880
Yeah.

00:36:38.970 --> 00:36:40.090
They got us again

00:36:40.220 --> 00:36:41.300
Don't worry about it!

00:37:01.660 --> 00:37:03.900
Leave us alone!!

00:37:13.250 --> 00:37:15.040
Good. They're finished.

00:37:15.130 --> 00:37:17.500
Let's do it.
You morons over there!

00:37:17.590 --> 00:37:19.170
- Mm?
- Nami-san!!

00:37:19.300 --> 00:37:21.460
Hurry up and throw the rings on them!!

00:37:21.550 --> 00:37:23.250
Oh yeah!

00:37:27.600 --> 00:37:29.260
Nami-san! I'm here!

00:37:29.350 --> 00:37:30.930
Get me down!

00:37:35.820 --> 00:37:36.930
Mm! You?!

00:37:37.030 --> 00:37:40.730
"Stay alert, old people fight,
better than you think."

00:37:41.070 --> 00:37:42.940
I'm Kerojee.

00:37:52.130 --> 00:37:53.660
Watch it!!

00:37:53.750 --> 00:37:54.830
Ouch!

00:37:59.180 --> 00:38:00.360
YOU watch it!

00:38:00.470 --> 00:38:01.540
Kerojee, nice going!

00:38:01.640 --> 00:38:02.710
You're in my way!

00:38:02.800 --> 00:38:04.050
Move! YOU move!

00:38:04.180 --> 00:38:05.560
No, YOU!

00:38:05.720 --> 00:38:08.760
It doesn't matter which one
of you does it! Just get him!

00:38:19.570 --> 00:38:20.900
That was dangerous!!

00:38:27.160 --> 00:38:28.540
You guys...!

00:38:28.870 --> 00:38:30.360
I said get out my way!

00:38:30.460 --> 00:38:31.610
What?!

00:38:31.790 --> 00:38:33.030
You guys!! Heads up!

00:38:34.040 --> 00:38:37.410
“When rabbits die, the fox will mourn. “

00:38:39.880 --> 00:38:41.070
That was close...

00:38:41.890 --> 00:38:42.920
Wh-What is this thing?!

00:38:43.010 --> 00:38:46.090
Oh no, I missed one.

00:38:46.470 --> 00:38:48.340
Hey! No! This guy's...

00:38:48.480 --> 00:38:50.630
Don't make excuses. It's pathetic.

00:38:50.730 --> 00:38:52.300
I can take care of this guy myself.

00:38:52.400 --> 00:38:54.680
When the TWO of you couldn't?

00:38:55.070 --> 00:38:57.630
Now there's no one that'll get in my way.

00:38:57.730 --> 00:38:59.890
Who're you talking about?!

00:39:00.900 --> 00:39:04.360
You guys! Will you stop fighting?!
We can't win if...

00:39:04.490 --> 00:39:06.400
- Kerojee is strong.
- What?

00:39:06.490 --> 00:39:09.610
He's been doing this for tens of years.

00:39:09.700 --> 00:39:12.190
Then he should be getting too old for this!

00:39:12.290 --> 00:39:13.320
Kero kero kero kero kero...

00:39:15.920 --> 00:39:18.400
What are these old people...?

00:39:18.920 --> 00:39:20.040
Pirates?

00:39:20.130 --> 00:39:25.710
Yes. Those men...
Baron Omatsuri and his men were pirates.

00:39:26.930 --> 00:39:29.880
Oh my God... They really were pirates...

00:39:29.970 --> 00:39:32.730
I found this when we were
trying to find our way off this island.

00:39:32.810 --> 00:39:38.720
An island of festivals? Too good to be true.
This is an island of pirates!

00:39:39.440 --> 00:39:44.100
But why would pirates
want other pirates to come here?

00:39:44.950 --> 00:39:51.440
- Huh? -Pirates invite other pirates
to do a trial to look for strong pirates...

00:39:51.910 --> 00:39:53.650
And then what?

00:39:54.330 --> 00:39:57.580
...Uhh... I was wondering about that too.

00:39:57.670 --> 00:39:58.940
You don't know that part then?!

00:39:59.050 --> 00:40:00.370
I'm sorry.

00:40:00.670 --> 00:40:03.240
Anyway, I should go tell everyone.

00:40:03.550 --> 00:40:04.580
Hm?

00:40:04.680 --> 00:40:05.710
What.

00:40:05.800 --> 00:40:09.710
If you look closely, doesn't this
wanted poster look a bit strange?

00:40:11.220 --> 00:40:12.260
Huh? Umm...

00:40:15.980 --> 00:40:19.600
“Oh little fox, where's that
fiery spirit you had a little earlier?“

00:40:19.690 --> 00:40:23.020
Shut up! Just wait. I'm gonna finish you off.

00:40:23.110 --> 00:40:24.890
Three sword technique.

00:40:32.040 --> 00:40:33.310
Oni...

00:40:33.540 --> 00:40:34.570
Giri...

00:40:36.290 --> 00:40:39.780
“Now with this, the enemy
is defeated, it's our victory. “

00:40:42.670 --> 00:40:46.170
“Just one second! There's someone else
that you have forgotten“!!

00:40:46.890 --> 00:40:50.210
Usopp Hammer!!

00:40:56.310 --> 00:40:59.470
"How'd you like that?! That was
Usopp's attack from the air"!!

00:41:02.400 --> 00:41:04.880
You guys were pathetic!

00:41:05.490 --> 00:41:08.810
Nami! I'm glad you're okay...

00:41:09.950 --> 00:41:11.980
That hurt! Why'd you do that?!

00:41:12.080 --> 00:41:13.900
You betrayed me back there!

00:41:14.000 --> 00:41:17.940
Betrayed you? What are you talking about?
Betrayal is YOUR specialty!!

00:41:19.290 --> 00:41:21.530
I'm gonna get you back for that.

00:41:21.630 --> 00:41:23.080
Huh? What did I say?

00:41:25.050 --> 00:41:27.290
I said I'm gonna get you back.

00:41:28.010 --> 00:41:31.630
You guys... What happened?

00:41:32.060 --> 00:41:34.130
Stop laughing! You lost, you know!

00:41:34.520 --> 00:41:37.880
Look! Fireworks to celebrate your
victory!

00:41:43.020 --> 00:41:48.140
“An ephemeral victory, intoxicated
with joy under flowers in the sky.“

00:41:50.530 --> 00:41:52.150
- I know!!
- Huh?

00:41:52.410 --> 00:41:56.820
Look carefully! Only the Baron
in this poster is really young.

00:41:57.500 --> 00:41:58.910
Oh...You're right...

00:41:59.250 --> 00:42:00.910
But why is that?

00:42:01.460 --> 00:42:04.870
That's probably because...

00:42:10.640 --> 00:42:11.460
Mm?

00:42:36.200 --> 00:42:39.450
What? Did I see something from the air?

00:42:39.620 --> 00:42:41.410
Yes. Like a flower or something.

00:42:41.500 --> 00:42:42.690
Flower?

00:42:42.790 --> 00:42:44.580
Flower huh...

00:42:44.670 --> 00:42:45.910
To think about it...

00:42:46.090 --> 00:42:48.000
To think about it, where's Chopper?

00:42:48.090 --> 00:42:51.620
I don't know. But he told Robin
he'll be right back, so I'm sure he will be.

00:42:52.010 --> 00:42:53.330
Hey, do you know where Chopper is?

00:42:53.430 --> 00:42:56.250
Like I said, he said he'll be back soon.

00:42:56.390 --> 00:42:57.800
Hm? Where's Chopper?

00:42:57.890 --> 00:42:59.010
He said...!!

00:42:59.100 --> 00:43:00.680
I wasn't asking YOU!

00:43:00.770 --> 00:43:03.890
Nami, are you still mad at me?

00:43:04.190 --> 00:43:06.010
Captain, will you do something?

00:43:06.110 --> 00:43:07.810
They've been like this all afternoon.

00:43:10.030 --> 00:43:14.610
What are you fighting about? I thought
you were a chummy group of pirates.

00:43:14.740 --> 00:43:16.400
You must be kidding.

00:43:17.910 --> 00:43:21.850
In any case, I am going to
treat you to a banquet tonight!

00:43:21.960 --> 00:43:23.230
Banquet?

00:43:25.790 --> 00:43:27.200
What? What?

00:43:29.550 --> 00:43:33.290
We will now open
the outdoor barbeque restaurant!

00:43:38.470 --> 00:43:39.750
A cooking performance, huh?

00:43:45.310 --> 00:43:46.430
He's spreading oil!

00:43:46.520 --> 00:43:47.600
Nothing special about it.

00:43:55.490 --> 00:43:56.520
He's fast!!!

00:43:56.620 --> 00:43:57.690
Nothing special at all.

00:44:00.040 --> 00:44:02.280
It looks great! It looks great! It looks great!

00:44:11.260 --> 00:44:13.820
You're in the way, kid. Go away.

00:44:13.970 --> 00:44:15.000
Luffy,

00:44:15.220 --> 00:44:19.710
I'll make you something 100 times
better than this fatso right here.

00:44:20.560 --> 00:44:22.550
There are no ingredients for you.

00:44:22.640 --> 00:44:24.680
It doesn't matter...

00:44:24.770 --> 00:44:26.150
I'll just take yours!

00:44:42.200 --> 00:44:43.240
Go! Go! Go!

00:44:43.330 --> 00:44:44.570
Go, go...

00:44:46.830 --> 00:44:49.080
Where are you going, Miss?

00:44:51.300 --> 00:44:53.000
...A walk before dinner.

00:44:53.090 --> 00:44:55.330
Right in the middle of a party?

00:44:55.590 --> 00:44:57.920
I'm looking for a flower for the dinner table.

00:44:58.010 --> 00:45:00.880
Are you not satisfied with
the one on my shoulder?

00:45:01.770 --> 00:45:03.800
Lily... Carnation...

00:45:04.730 --> 00:45:07.260
Hm? What are you talking about?

00:45:07.350 --> 00:45:10.300
The kind owner of
the goldfish told me about it.

00:45:10.770 --> 00:45:13.060
I hear it only grows on this island.

00:45:13.150 --> 00:45:14.600
A beautiful flower, he said.

00:45:26.080 --> 00:45:29.530
Sanji-kun! You're doing great! Go! Go!

00:45:29.790 --> 00:45:32.990
Yes, Sanji! Go! Go!

00:45:34.880 --> 00:45:36.580
Sanji-kun!!

00:45:38.090 --> 00:45:41.340
Yeah! Go! Go!

00:45:50.520 --> 00:45:51.930
What's wrong with her?

00:45:53.320 --> 00:45:56.730
She doesn't have to get THAT mad at me!

00:45:56.860 --> 00:45:59.270
What did I do...?! Damn her! Ouch!!

00:46:01.030 --> 00:46:02.060
Good evening pu.

00:46:03.240 --> 00:46:04.730
Wh-What is this guy?!

00:46:04.830 --> 00:46:07.580
- You have a cool hat pu. Let me have it. pu.
- Huh?!

00:46:08.000 --> 00:46:09.570
Your hat. Give it to me pu.

00:46:10.290 --> 00:46:13.410
Why do I have to give it you?!

00:46:13.550 --> 00:46:15.240
Don't say that pu!

00:46:15.340 --> 00:46:17.040
No way.
Give it to me pu!

00:46:17.130 --> 00:46:20.080
Why do you keep saying “pu“?
What is it with “pu“?

00:46:20.260 --> 00:46:22.130
Did you just make fun of me?

00:46:22.220 --> 00:46:23.840
Uh... No... Not really...

00:46:23.930 --> 00:46:25.800
You did pu! You made fun of me pu!

00:46:25.890 --> 00:46:26.960
“Pu“ again? Pu pu...

00:46:27.060 --> 00:46:28.220
See?!

00:46:28.310 --> 00:46:30.930
- You made fun of me again pu!
- You're getting out of control.

00:46:31.020 --> 00:46:32.400
...I'm not gonna forgive you pu.

00:46:32.480 --> 00:46:33.890
Why are we having this conversation?

00:46:33.980 --> 00:46:35.220
I'm not gonna forgive you pu...

00:46:42.070 --> 00:46:46.360
Light-flavored sauce!! Seaweed!!
And top it with red ginger, and it's done.

00:46:46.450 --> 00:46:49.070
The Omatsuri Island Special Fried Noodles...

00:46:49.290 --> 00:46:51.070
For your pleasure!

00:46:52.750 --> 00:46:53.940
Huh?! Wh-What are you doing?!

00:46:54.500 --> 00:46:56.450
Thank... you... very... much!!

00:46:57.510 --> 00:46:58.960
What?!

00:47:07.850 --> 00:47:09.010
Special thick sauce!

00:47:09.100 --> 00:47:10.510
Lemon-flavoured mayo!

00:47:10.640 --> 00:47:12.800
- And then...!
- What?!

00:47:13.940 --> 00:47:16.690
Thin shavings of dried bonito dance on

00:47:16.780 --> 00:47:18.770
my original modern-yaki

00:47:20.240 --> 00:47:21.850
Please enjoy.

00:47:23.780 --> 00:47:25.690
Oh my God...

00:47:27.120 --> 00:47:28.190
Ouch! Ouch!

00:47:28.660 --> 00:47:32.600
Robin-chan, did you see that?
My complete victory...

00:47:32.960 --> 00:47:34.120
She's not here!

00:47:34.210 --> 00:47:37.790
Then Nami-san... Can you see this?
A token of my love to you...

00:47:38.510 --> 00:47:39.880
She's not watching!

00:47:40.970 --> 00:47:43.170
I don't feel like doing this anymore...

00:47:43.260 --> 00:47:45.290
Bon appetit!

00:47:45.800 --> 00:47:46.920
It's hot!

00:47:47.140 --> 00:47:50.340
I can't drink anymore...
I've been drinking since during the day.

00:47:50.430 --> 00:47:54.510
Are you refusing to drink with a girl like me?

00:47:54.650 --> 00:47:58.890
No, it's not like that. With a beautiful lady
like you, I can keep drinking forever.

00:47:59.320 --> 00:48:00.350
Beautiful?

00:48:00.440 --> 00:48:03.560
Oh. Come on!
You don't have to be so honest.

00:48:03.660 --> 00:48:06.440
Anyway, who is that Flower Man?

00:48:06.620 --> 00:48:08.900
Is he the king of this island? Really rich?

00:48:09.080 --> 00:48:10.900
- What did you just say?
- Hm?

00:48:11.000 --> 00:48:14.200
You just called
the Baron Flower Man, didn't you?

00:48:14.420 --> 00:48:17.530
Do that again, and I'll never forgive you!

00:48:17.670 --> 00:48:22.330
That man is the best!
He's strong and brave and kind!

00:48:22.420 --> 00:48:25.580
A man's man's
man's man's man.

00:48:25.680 --> 00:48:26.920
Too many “mans“ there, don't you think?

00:48:27.050 --> 00:48:30.800
No! That's not even enough.
He's that great of a person.

00:48:30.890 --> 00:48:35.180
I respect him with all my heart,
and that's why I continue to serve him.

00:48:35.310 --> 00:48:39.470
So anyway... Why are you here with ME,
when your friends are over there?

00:48:39.730 --> 00:48:40.770
Why?

00:48:42.150 --> 00:48:43.980
I wonder why...

00:48:44.070 --> 00:48:46.480
We're not like this usually...

00:48:46.570 --> 00:48:47.760
Did something happen?

00:48:47.990 --> 00:48:51.930
No. I just wanted to talk to you, Mucchy.

00:48:52.160 --> 00:48:54.990
M-Mucchy? What's Mucchy?

00:48:55.170 --> 00:48:57.450
Because you're Muchigoro-san.

00:48:58.250 --> 00:48:59.520
I-I'm Mucchy?

00:48:59.670 --> 00:49:01.200
Yes, Mucchy.

00:49:04.880 --> 00:49:06.500
Call me Mucchy.

00:49:07.970 --> 00:49:10.290
Zoro, get up! This is great!!

00:49:11.640 --> 00:49:14.260
Mm? Oh... Time to eat, huh?
Okay, let's eat then.

00:49:14.350 --> 00:49:15.510
- I won't let you. You were sleeping.
- Huh?

00:49:16.560 --> 00:49:19.310
You don't have the right to eat
since you weren't cheering me on.

00:49:19.400 --> 00:49:20.430
Huh?!

00:49:21.110 --> 00:49:23.350
Robin-chan!! Where are you?!

00:49:24.150 --> 00:49:27.480
Dinner is ready!

00:49:27.570 --> 00:49:28.760
What a leech.

00:49:29.200 --> 00:49:33.990
Robin-chan!! Robin-chan!!

00:49:35.250 --> 00:49:36.280
Not here?

00:49:55.770 --> 00:49:57.590
Oh yeah, Namippé,

00:49:57.690 --> 00:50:00.930
we were actually pirates, just like you guys.

00:50:01.020 --> 00:50:04.140
Our name... the Red Arrows Pirates.

00:50:04.230 --> 00:50:05.420
Red Arrows...

00:50:05.690 --> 00:50:08.310
Yes, we were very, very strong.

00:50:08.410 --> 00:50:11.520
Obviously, it is because
the Baron was our captain.

00:50:11.620 --> 00:50:14.400
I bet he's even stronger than that Roger.

00:50:14.540 --> 00:50:16.110
That Roger? Which Roger?

00:50:16.830 --> 00:50:18.240
That's a surprise!

00:50:18.330 --> 00:50:21.700
You're a pirate, but you don't
even know who Gold Roger is?

00:50:22.000 --> 00:50:25.080
Gold Roger? You mean
the pioneer of the Great Age of Pirates?

00:50:25.340 --> 00:50:28.370
You do know.
So have you met him?

00:50:28.470 --> 00:50:31.750
Of course not. He was executed years ago.

00:50:31.850 --> 00:50:32.880
Executed?

00:50:32.970 --> 00:50:37.050
Y-Yeah... Gold Roger's
been dead for over 20 years, right?

00:50:37.180 --> 00:50:40.720
- What are you talking about? That's absurd.
-What...?

00:50:44.270 --> 00:50:47.480
Because I just saw Gold Roger the other day.

00:50:47.900 --> 00:50:49.020
The other day?

00:50:50.200 --> 00:50:53.690
Yes... Before the night of the big storm...

00:50:54.580 --> 00:50:57.360
It was an awful storm...

00:50:58.710 --> 00:51:00.740
Night of the storm...?

00:51:01.500 --> 00:51:05.360
What are you talking about?
Mucchy?! Mucchy!

00:51:12.840 --> 00:51:16.840
Yes... This is the only ship
that was wrecked by natural forces.

00:51:17.060 --> 00:51:20.300
It must be that Baron's ship...

00:51:21.230 --> 00:51:24.680
But this is odd...
I thought it would be here.

00:51:30.530 --> 00:51:32.310
The secret flower...

00:51:34.910 --> 00:51:36.480
Lily Carnation...

00:51:39.450 --> 00:51:42.570
The flower of death and rebirth...

00:51:54.510 --> 00:51:55.840
Wh-What's that...?!

00:51:55.930 --> 00:51:57.960
The flower you were looking for.

00:51:59.930 --> 00:52:01.050
This is a flower?

00:52:02.730 --> 00:52:04.300
You're saying this is a flower?!

00:52:07.270 --> 00:52:10.980
Mucchy! What happened
that night of the storm?!

00:52:11.070 --> 00:52:12.520
Mucchy, tell me!

00:52:12.650 --> 00:52:14.810
Mu...

00:52:29.460 --> 00:52:32.710
No! This can't be a flower!

00:52:41.180 --> 00:52:43.850
- Yo Captain! Stop eating and do something!
-Huh?

00:52:44.350 --> 00:52:46.010
Robin-chan's gone!

00:52:46.100 --> 00:52:47.140
She is?!

00:52:47.230 --> 00:52:48.800
She said she was gonna
go check out the flower.

00:52:48.900 --> 00:52:50.470
Flower?
When was that?

00:52:50.570 --> 00:52:51.970
It can't take this long!

00:52:52.070 --> 00:52:53.100
Where's Usopp?

00:52:53.190 --> 00:52:54.980
What? I don't know... isn't he around?

00:52:55.070 --> 00:52:56.230
Usopp's gone too?

00:52:56.320 --> 00:52:57.810
Chopper hasn't come back yet either.

00:52:57.910 --> 00:52:59.070
- Oh my God...
- Something's going on.

00:52:59.160 --> 00:53:00.190
I have a bad feeling.

00:53:00.290 --> 00:53:01.610
You talking in your sleep?

00:53:01.700 --> 00:53:03.360
What were you doing all this time?

00:53:03.500 --> 00:53:05.610
- What do you mean?
- I'm saying you should have paid attention!

00:53:05.710 --> 00:53:08.950
They're not kids!
I don't have to chaperone them!

00:53:09.040 --> 00:53:12.040
Three of them are gone!
But how come nobody noticed?!

00:53:12.130 --> 00:53:13.080
But...

00:53:18.090 --> 00:53:19.170
But...

00:53:20.310 --> 00:53:23.510
Luffy, what are you gonna do?

00:53:23.890 --> 00:53:25.270
This was your idea in the first place!

00:53:25.350 --> 00:53:26.380
Sanji-kun!

00:53:26.480 --> 00:53:28.050
You're the one who
decided to come to this island!

00:53:28.150 --> 00:53:30.260
Stop it! It's no use saying that now!

00:53:30.360 --> 00:53:32.010
This happened all because of you.

00:53:32.650 --> 00:53:34.810
Luffy, you did this.

00:53:36.490 --> 00:53:37.560
My fault...?

00:53:39.660 --> 00:53:40.690
Muchigoro...

00:53:42.950 --> 00:53:44.140
Listen, everybody! The banquet is over!!

00:53:44.250 --> 00:53:46.400
We will restart the Trial of Hell!

00:53:47.210 --> 00:53:49.990
Everyone, take your positions!
Get DJ over here!

00:53:50.090 --> 00:53:51.120
Good evening pu.

00:53:51.210 --> 00:53:52.450
I'm DJ Kappa.

00:53:53.050 --> 00:53:54.080
Nice to meet you pu.

00:53:54.170 --> 00:53:57.120
Hold it! Where're Usopp and Robin-chan?!

00:53:57.220 --> 00:53:58.290
Where's Chopper?!

00:53:58.380 --> 00:54:00.040
Bring them to us right now!

00:54:00.140 --> 00:54:02.090
Did you guys just ignore me?

00:54:02.180 --> 00:54:03.800
Hey! You just ignored me, didn't you?

00:54:03.970 --> 00:54:05.160
Shut up, Water Imp!

00:54:05.270 --> 00:54:06.380
W-Water imp?!

00:54:06.520 --> 00:54:09.000
That hat... It's Usopp's, isn't it?!

00:54:10.690 --> 00:54:11.930
G-Give it back pu!

00:54:12.020 --> 00:54:14.970
Hey... What did you do to Usopp...?!

00:54:16.780 --> 00:54:19.650
Hee hee!
They're somewhere on this island pu!

00:54:19.740 --> 00:54:21.690
Try to find them if you can pu!

00:54:21.780 --> 00:54:23.400
So you guys DID do something to them!!

00:54:23.540 --> 00:54:24.650
Don't get so feisty.

00:54:24.740 --> 00:54:26.940
First, I'll tell you what the next trial is.

00:54:27.040 --> 00:54:29.070
Who cares about thatl! Where are they?!

00:54:29.170 --> 00:54:30.660
The trial first.

00:54:30.750 --> 00:54:32.280
Shut up! Our friends first!

00:54:32.630 --> 00:54:34.240
I said the trial first!!

00:54:35.590 --> 00:54:38.830
This isn't going anywhere...
I'm gonna go look for them alone!

00:54:38.930 --> 00:54:40.170
Sanji-kun! Wait a minute!

00:54:40.260 --> 00:54:42.930
I'm not in the mood for any Trial of Hell!

00:54:43.010 --> 00:54:44.050
Zoro!!

00:54:44.140 --> 00:54:47.720
The fools!
They left without hearing what the trial is!

00:54:50.190 --> 00:54:52.050
There are no rules to this trial.

00:54:52.150 --> 00:54:54.390
One hundred snipers will be shooting at you.

00:54:55.440 --> 00:54:57.480
If you think you can escape them,

00:54:57.570 --> 00:55:00.560
go look for your friends.

00:55:00.660 --> 00:55:02.730
Luffy... What should we do...?

00:55:03.240 --> 00:55:04.270
Luffy!!

00:55:05.120 --> 00:55:06.150
Luffy!!

00:55:06.240 --> 00:55:07.780
Begin!

00:55:08.910 --> 00:55:10.320
I'm going alone!

00:55:22.300 --> 00:55:24.290
Mm? Aren't you going?

00:55:25.600 --> 00:55:28.710
A captain of a pirate ship is going to
abandon his crew?

00:55:28.980 --> 00:55:32.010
That's all there is to your bond?

00:55:34.270 --> 00:55:36.220
Give me back my friends!!

00:55:38.400 --> 00:55:40.140
That's the spirit!

00:55:59.050 --> 00:56:00.370
It's no use running away.

00:56:19.820 --> 00:56:22.440
Straw Hat. Straw Hat.

00:56:39.210 --> 00:56:40.540
Dammit...

00:56:42.300 --> 00:56:43.460
What's that sound?

00:56:53.270 --> 00:56:54.880
How can we look for them like this!

00:56:55.350 --> 00:56:57.390
It's no use running away pu!

00:57:06.570 --> 00:57:09.020
I said it's no use running away pu.

00:57:29.720 --> 00:57:33.210
This all happened
because you pissed me off pu. Mm?

00:57:38.900 --> 00:57:42.390
That was hotl!
Why'd you do that?! You little brat!!

00:57:43.150 --> 00:57:44.980
Oni... Giri!

00:57:50.490 --> 00:57:51.610
What?!

00:57:51.700 --> 00:57:53.690
You just cut me...

00:57:53.830 --> 00:57:56.610
But I won't die...
I won't even bleed...

00:57:56.870 --> 00:57:57.950
Why not?

00:57:58.040 --> 00:58:00.030
Damn! What kind of technique is that?!

00:58:00.170 --> 00:58:01.240
Technique?

00:58:03.210 --> 00:58:04.540
How was that?!

00:58:04.880 --> 00:58:06.500
What's a technique?

00:58:06.720 --> 00:58:08.210
I don't believe this!

00:58:10.930 --> 00:58:13.380
Wh-What was that...?

00:58:14.600 --> 00:58:17.010
DJ, are you all right?

00:58:17.520 --> 00:58:19.390
I'm sorry pu, Sir Baron.

00:58:20.810 --> 00:58:26.240
But how come I don't die
when pirates shoot at me or cut me pu?

00:58:26.320 --> 00:58:28.310
That's because you're strong.

00:58:28.610 --> 00:58:30.190
It's really weird pu.

00:58:30.280 --> 00:58:33.820
Because I'm not as strong
as Kerojee or Muchigoro pu.

00:58:33.910 --> 00:58:35.990
You ARE really strong.

00:58:37.750 --> 00:58:39.120
That's what I thought.

00:58:40.080 --> 00:58:41.240
I am, aren't I...?

00:58:42.670 --> 00:58:44.410
Only the Straw Hat is left pu.

00:58:44.500 --> 00:58:46.830
I'll get him for sure pu.

00:58:51.470 --> 00:58:52.500
Mm? What's wrong?

00:58:52.930 --> 00:58:54.170
I got dizzy...

00:58:54.810 --> 00:58:56.960
But I'm used to it pu.

00:59:09.280 --> 00:59:12.770
I don't feel too well...
Maybe I played around too much...

00:59:13.280 --> 00:59:16.070
Just get some sleep...

00:59:16.290 --> 00:59:22.810
When you wake up,
you'll be an energetic old woman again.

00:59:22.920 --> 00:59:27.290
That's true... It's like always...

00:59:30.340 --> 00:59:33.170
Wh-Where's everyone?

00:59:34.180 --> 00:59:35.450
I can't see anything...

00:59:35.600 --> 00:59:36.920
It's completely dark...

00:59:37.890 --> 00:59:39.270
You're up?

00:59:41.390 --> 00:59:43.090
- It's you!
- We meet again.

00:59:43.190 --> 00:59:44.220
The guy with a booger!

00:59:44.310 --> 00:59:45.350
It's a toothbrush moustache!

00:59:45.440 --> 00:59:46.850
Why am I here in a place like this?

00:59:46.940 --> 00:59:48.320
Stop complaining.

00:59:48.400 --> 00:59:51.190
I dug out tunnels and
escape routes all over the island

00:59:51.280 --> 00:59:54.400
so I can flee from the Baron's evil hands.

00:59:54.740 --> 00:59:58.030
Luckily, you fell on top of one of them.

00:59:59.160 --> 01:00:02.610
You were in real danger,
with the Baron coming after you.

01:00:02.710 --> 01:00:05.160
I can't stay here! I have to go...

01:00:05.250 --> 01:00:07.030
- Hold on.
- My friends are waiting for me.

01:00:07.130 --> 01:00:08.870
- I said hold on.
- See ya!

01:00:09.420 --> 01:00:10.450
What? What?

01:00:12.760 --> 01:00:14.790
It's not that easy to get out of here.

01:00:14.890 --> 01:00:17.250
The tunnels are complicated.

01:00:17.350 --> 01:00:19.340
I'm the only person who knows the way out.

01:00:19.640 --> 01:00:21.090
Then tell me!!

01:00:21.310 --> 01:00:23.180
Ah! Welcome to my secret base!

01:00:23.270 --> 01:00:25.010
It's been a long time since I had a visitor.

01:00:25.110 --> 01:00:26.350
Do you like goat's milk?

01:00:26.440 --> 01:00:27.850
I don't want any!

01:00:30.150 --> 01:00:34.440
So, why don't you reconsider?
We should become a team.

01:00:34.570 --> 01:00:35.610
No!

01:00:35.700 --> 01:00:40.690
Now don't say that. The Chobihigé
Pirates are always looking for new members.

01:00:43.250 --> 01:00:45.410
Are these your friends?

01:00:45.710 --> 01:00:48.030
- Hm? Oh, yes...
- They all look like you.

01:00:48.130 --> 01:00:49.830
Yeah, because we're a team.

01:00:49.920 --> 01:00:52.160
But I haven't seen anyone besides you.

01:00:52.260 --> 01:00:54.930
Where are the others? In a different base?

01:00:55.260 --> 01:00:56.960
It's just me now.

01:00:59.060 --> 01:01:02.800
Currently, I'm the only
member of the Chobihigé Pirates.

01:01:07.770 --> 01:01:09.970
I still remember...

01:01:11.150 --> 01:01:15.230
When my
dear friends were captured by the Baron...

01:01:15.320 --> 01:01:19.940
When they were swallowed by
that giant monster...

01:01:30.590 --> 01:01:33.410
Hm...? I thought I was hit by an arrow...

01:01:38.390 --> 01:01:39.630
I'm scared... I'm so scared...

01:01:40.180 --> 01:01:43.460
Don't be scared...
Daddy's right here, so don't be scared...

01:01:43.600 --> 01:01:45.720
I'm hungry! I'm hungry!

01:01:47.810 --> 01:01:49.680
I'm sorry to make you wait, Lily.

01:01:50.770 --> 01:01:52.310
It's time to eat.

01:02:10.290 --> 01:02:11.410
Daisy!!

01:02:15.630 --> 01:02:17.420
- Daddy!!
- Daisy!!

01:02:17.550 --> 01:02:18.820
Daddy, help me!!

01:02:18.930 --> 01:02:21.630
Daisy!! Daisy!!

01:02:28.230 --> 01:02:29.500
Daisy!

01:02:29.600 --> 01:02:31.350
Now's your chance! Run!

01:02:35.610 --> 01:02:36.800
Hurry UP!

01:02:36.900 --> 01:02:38.940
Reindeer-san! Hurry!

01:02:40.870 --> 01:02:43.270
Just as I thought.
I knew you would be strong.

01:02:46.870 --> 01:02:50.200
It's the first time I'm offering Lily
someone with the power of a Devil Fruit.

01:02:50.290 --> 01:02:51.950
Dammit! Let me go!

01:02:52.040 --> 01:02:53.120
Let me go!

01:03:06.470 --> 01:03:07.630
Daisy!

01:03:15.320 --> 01:03:16.690
I told you to run...

01:03:16.780 --> 01:03:18.980
Kids!! What are you doing?!
Come back here now!!

01:03:19.280 --> 01:03:23.560
Daddy! You have to help Reindeer-san!
You're really strong, aren't you?!

01:03:23.660 --> 01:03:26.030
Show us how strong you are!

01:03:30.120 --> 01:03:31.160
Daddy!!

01:03:32.710 --> 01:03:35.460
What?! Wh-What are you doing?
Daddy, don't!!

01:03:40.050 --> 01:03:41.320
Daddy! Why?!

01:03:41.470 --> 01:03:43.710
He saved Daisy, you know!

01:03:43.800 --> 01:03:46.370
Let us go! Let us go!

01:03:49.020 --> 01:03:50.170
You coward!

01:03:53.560 --> 01:03:57.270
Yeah... Call me a coward if you want.

01:04:00.150 --> 01:04:03.020
Very good! Fight! Fight harder!

01:04:03.110 --> 01:04:06.230
More than anything, I love watching a
group of pirates fight amongst themselves!

01:04:06.490 --> 01:04:09.400
What's wrong?! Keep fighting!

01:04:09.750 --> 01:04:12.780
The Baron once told me...

01:04:13.080 --> 01:04:16.330
It makes him furious to see friends like us.

01:04:16.460 --> 01:04:20.160
It makes him want to break us up,
to cut us into pieces one by one.

01:04:20.260 --> 01:04:23.210
He wants us to feel the same way he does.

01:04:23.510 --> 01:04:24.540
The same way he does?

01:04:24.640 --> 01:04:26.340
I don't know what goes through his head.

01:04:26.470 --> 01:04:30.300
But I do know for sure that he hates pirates
who are strongly bonded to one another.

01:04:31.140 --> 01:04:33.130
Don't fight him by yourself.

01:04:33.230 --> 01:04:35.640
That's exactly what he wants you to do.

01:04:35.730 --> 01:04:37.000
Then what should we do?

01:04:37.110 --> 01:04:38.180
That's...

01:04:38.650 --> 01:04:41.850
Baron!! Don't think for
a second that you've won!

01:04:41.950 --> 01:04:43.810
My friends are going to come save me!

01:04:43.910 --> 01:04:46.230
Then they're gonna beat you up!

01:04:46.700 --> 01:04:49.530
They're not going to come
no matter how long you wait.

01:04:49.620 --> 01:04:51.070
That's not true! I know they will!

01:04:51.160 --> 01:04:53.030
It is true. Nobody will come for you.

01:04:53.120 --> 01:04:55.070
Yes, they will! I have faith in them!

01:04:55.170 --> 01:04:56.620
I said they aren't coming.

01:04:56.710 --> 01:04:58.740
I know they will! I know it!!

01:04:59.170 --> 01:05:01.410
Why don't you get it?! Nobody is coming!!

01:05:05.470 --> 01:05:07.040
- Nami!
- Sanji!

01:05:07.140 --> 01:05:08.410
- Usopp!
- Robin!

01:05:08.560 --> 01:05:09.590
Zoro!

01:05:10.100 --> 01:05:12.130
You guys! You guys!

01:05:12.810 --> 01:05:15.760
Friends this, friends that...

01:05:15.850 --> 01:05:18.220
Everybody... friends, friends, friends...

01:05:19.980 --> 01:05:22.230
You are Lily's feed.

01:05:35.250 --> 01:05:36.320
What's wrong, Straw Hat?

01:05:36.460 --> 01:05:37.570
- Oh no...
- What?

01:05:38.210 --> 01:05:40.960
- I don't have time to sit around here all day.
- H-Hey...

01:05:44.840 --> 01:05:45.920
Straw Hat, wait!

01:05:46.010 --> 01:05:47.200
Thanks for everything.

01:05:47.590 --> 01:05:49.710
Straw Hat!! Don't go alone!

01:05:49.800 --> 01:05:51.180
Straw Hat!

01:06:06.950 --> 01:06:10.650
Hm? Sir Baron? What am I doing here...?

01:06:12.490 --> 01:06:14.030
Sir Baron...

01:06:14.290 --> 01:06:16.850
Ahh, Muchigoro. You're awake.

01:06:17.170 --> 01:06:20.950
It feels like I was in this long, long dream...

01:06:21.040 --> 01:06:22.950
I'm sorry, Sir Baron.

01:06:23.050 --> 01:06:25.120
That's quite all right. Don't worry about it.

01:06:25.590 --> 01:06:29.530
All that matters to me is
that you're all alive and well.

01:06:29.640 --> 01:06:32.750
Well? I'm always well!

01:06:33.140 --> 01:06:34.880
Watch me!

01:06:36.270 --> 01:06:37.840
Did you see that?!

01:06:38.730 --> 01:06:40.470
I did, Muchigoro.

01:06:40.560 --> 01:06:42.140
I can do more!

01:06:45.610 --> 01:06:48.850
That's enough. Why don't you
go back to the others now?

01:06:49.160 --> 01:06:51.270
Yes, sir, Baron, sir!

01:07:04.090 --> 01:07:05.790
So you came, Straw Hat.

01:07:05.880 --> 01:07:07.790
How foolish of you,
when you didn't have to.

01:07:21.440 --> 01:07:22.630
This voice...

01:07:24.020 --> 01:07:25.350
Come on, let's go.

01:07:31.450 --> 01:07:32.480
Daisy!

01:07:34.200 --> 01:07:35.360
Quietly.

01:07:35.450 --> 01:07:36.900
Quietly

01:07:37.580 --> 01:07:39.240
Straw Hat!

01:07:39.330 --> 01:07:40.520
Ah! Who are you?!

01:07:40.620 --> 01:07:43.190
Hey Mister, where's Chopper?

01:07:43.590 --> 01:07:45.950
You mean that otter with horns?

01:07:46.590 --> 01:07:50.330
- Then he...
- Hey Mister, I have two things to say to you.

01:07:50.430 --> 01:07:53.790
One, Chopper is not an otter.
He's a reindeer.

01:07:53.890 --> 01:07:57.260
Two, I will NOT let you hurt my friends.

01:07:57.350 --> 01:07:59.760
Hurt your friends?

01:08:00.390 --> 01:08:03.300
You had six friends with you, did you not?

01:08:04.060 --> 01:08:05.970
Just a while ago,

01:08:06.070 --> 01:08:07.810
the number became five.

01:08:11.400 --> 01:08:12.780
What did you say...?

01:08:14.240 --> 01:08:18.100
Soon, the others will
also disappear inside Lily.

01:08:18.450 --> 01:08:19.940
What?!

01:08:20.040 --> 01:08:25.380
And you come now to say
you won't let me hurt your friends.

01:08:27.380 --> 01:08:29.700
I will not let you hurt my friends...

01:08:36.140 --> 01:08:37.710
I won't allow it...

01:08:41.270 --> 01:08:43.010
I won't allow it!!

01:08:43.100 --> 01:08:47.180
Gum-Gum...!!

01:08:51.240 --> 01:08:54.150
Arrow number one.
What happened to all that fieriness you had?

01:08:54.450 --> 01:08:55.480
Dammit!

01:08:55.570 --> 01:08:59.860
While you're doing that
one more of your friends will disappear.

01:09:02.330 --> 01:09:04.410
D-Don't!!

01:09:05.380 --> 01:09:07.740
Robin!!

01:09:07.840 --> 01:09:09.870
Who's next?

01:09:11.590 --> 01:09:13.710
All right. The cook.

01:09:13.800 --> 01:09:15.040
You bastard!

01:09:15.140 --> 01:09:18.380
Gum-Gum...!

01:09:19.010 --> 01:09:20.250
Arrow number two.

01:09:20.470 --> 01:09:22.960
Sanji!

01:09:23.060 --> 01:09:27.300
Only three more. You better hurry,
or there'll be nobody left.

01:09:27.480 --> 01:09:28.550
Don't!!

01:09:28.650 --> 01:09:31.100
Gum-Gum...!!

01:09:34.900 --> 01:09:37.660
I'll tell you since you can't see.

01:09:37.780 --> 01:09:39.980
The Beak Nose just died.

01:09:40.240 --> 01:09:41.820
Usopp!

01:09:41.910 --> 01:09:45.070
What will you do?
Fight with your right leg only?

01:09:45.420 --> 01:09:48.370
Gum-Gum...!!

01:09:52.010 --> 01:09:54.870
Just now...
The other girl disappeared.

01:09:54.970 --> 01:09:56.580
N-Nami.

01:09:58.090 --> 01:10:00.960
There's nothing you can do looking like that.

01:10:03.270 --> 01:10:08.800
And the last of your friends
is about to disappear.

01:10:09.190 --> 01:10:11.100
Zoro!

01:10:32.550 --> 01:10:38.750
Zoro!!!

01:10:57.030 --> 01:10:58.520
Straw Hat,

01:10:59.200 --> 01:11:01.650
the swordsman just died.

01:11:05.040 --> 01:11:07.740
You no longer have any friends.

01:11:08.830 --> 01:11:13.160
In this vast Grand Line, you are all alone.

01:11:20.470 --> 01:11:21.660
Alone...

01:11:31.900 --> 01:11:35.100
Yes!! I feel good again all of a sudden pu!

01:11:44.660 --> 01:11:47.740
Come on! Do it faster!

01:11:53.420 --> 01:11:56.540
Give... me... back... my... friends...

01:11:58.300 --> 01:12:00.500
Are you hurting without your friends?

01:12:03.430 --> 01:12:08.090
You have lost all your friends.
This fact will never change.

01:12:08.180 --> 01:12:10.300
So, what are you going to do now?

01:12:10.390 --> 01:12:15.630
Even if you survive, only grief, despair
and endless lonely days will await you.

01:12:16.860 --> 01:12:19.610
Would you like to join your friends?

01:12:32.250 --> 01:12:34.240
For your information,

01:12:34.330 --> 01:12:37.740
most of the captains gave in to
the loneliness and have chosen to die.

01:12:37.840 --> 01:12:39.620
The most appropriate decision

01:12:39.710 --> 01:12:42.080
since you can't be a pirate all alone...

01:12:42.180 --> 01:12:45.130
So, I ask you once again.
Which will you choose?

01:12:45.220 --> 01:12:47.630
Life or death?

01:12:58.150 --> 01:13:00.430
You don't want to be alone, do you?

01:13:04.030 --> 01:13:05.220
Then die.

01:13:24.300 --> 01:13:25.370
What's this...?

01:13:28.260 --> 01:13:29.540
Baron!!

01:13:29.640 --> 01:13:32.550
- You again!
- I'm not gonna let this man die!

01:13:32.680 --> 01:13:33.870
You!!

01:13:34.520 --> 01:13:36.050
Where are you aiming?!

01:13:36.050 --> 01:13:37.980
Baaah!

01:13:37.980 --> 01:13:39.390
This way! Over here!

01:13:49.410 --> 01:13:50.980
The wisecrack...!

01:13:59.590 --> 01:14:01.700
- How is he?
- He's hurt really bad.

01:14:01.800 --> 01:14:03.750
- Hey, Straw Hat!
- Don't!

01:14:03.840 --> 01:14:05.460
Wake up, Straw Hat!

01:14:05.590 --> 01:14:06.670
Straw Hat!

01:14:08.300 --> 01:14:12.420
...My friends...they...it's my fault...

01:14:13.020 --> 01:14:16.510
Don't lose hope!
What happened to your spirit?!

01:14:16.600 --> 01:14:19.550
Be strong! You're the captain, aren't you?
Stand up on your own feet!

01:14:23.280 --> 01:14:24.890
Listen carefully, Straw Hat.

01:14:24.990 --> 01:14:27.900
- I don't think your friends are dead yet.
- Huh...?

01:14:30.240 --> 01:14:32.780
She can hear them calling you.

01:14:32.870 --> 01:14:34.740
- Are you Luffy?
- Yeah...

01:14:35.960 --> 01:14:37.780
Reindeer-san is calling out for you.

01:14:38.210 --> 01:14:39.400
Ch-Chopper is?!

01:14:39.630 --> 01:14:41.620
Where? Where is he?!

01:14:46.260 --> 01:14:47.420
I can't hear him!

01:14:47.680 --> 01:14:49.170
I can.

01:14:49.260 --> 01:14:51.250
I hear other people's voices too...

01:14:51.550 --> 01:14:53.170
Four... Five...

01:14:53.720 --> 01:14:56.590
They're saying, “Luffy! Luffy!“
Did you just hear that?

01:14:59.150 --> 01:15:00.180
Really...?

01:15:00.610 --> 01:15:03.640
Unfortunately, I can't hear
such voices either.

01:15:03.780 --> 01:15:07.060
But this girl knew your name
even though she's never met you.

01:15:07.150 --> 01:15:09.230
That is an unquestionable fact.

01:15:09.700 --> 01:15:13.020
Daisy, I didn't know
your hearing was so good.

01:15:13.120 --> 01:15:14.230
That's...

01:15:21.080 --> 01:15:23.870
Where are you?!
Straw Hat! Where did you go?!

01:15:29.970 --> 01:15:32.500
Don't go head on against the Baron's arrows.

01:15:32.640 --> 01:15:34.460
Use the network of tunnels.

01:15:34.600 --> 01:15:35.760
I'll back you up, so do as I say

01:15:35.850 --> 01:15:38.090
and head toward the flower.

01:15:39.100 --> 01:15:41.180
- You...
- You forgot this.

01:15:42.060 --> 01:15:44.140
Don't be fooled by the Baron's words.

01:15:44.230 --> 01:15:46.520
And listen. You aren't alone yet.

01:15:48.190 --> 01:15:50.140
I just wanted you to know that.

01:15:50.240 --> 01:15:53.900
You still have the chance
to save your friends.

01:15:54.200 --> 01:15:55.390
And plus...

01:15:55.580 --> 01:15:57.400
You have me.

01:15:58.000 --> 01:16:00.700
Now go! There's no time! Hurry up!

01:16:01.120 --> 01:16:02.570
What's that weird pose?

01:16:02.670 --> 01:16:04.990
What are you doing
during a serious conversation?

01:16:05.090 --> 01:16:06.240
Totally uncool.

01:16:06.420 --> 01:16:07.610
Ah, shut up!

01:16:07.710 --> 01:16:10.000
This is the traditional and sacred

01:16:10.090 --> 01:16:13.540
greeting among us
Chobihigé Pirates! Don't insult the...

01:16:26.730 --> 01:16:28.220
I found you!

01:16:45.500 --> 01:16:46.910
At least you're fast!

01:16:50.300 --> 01:16:51.370
Ha ha! I got you!

01:16:54.800 --> 01:16:58.210
Straw Hat! Go straight
and jump into the hole on the right!

01:16:58.310 --> 01:16:59.710
Then keep going!

01:17:05.610 --> 01:17:06.640
Good, Straw Hat!

01:17:15.320 --> 01:17:17.690
Damn you! I've had enough of this!

01:17:22.500 --> 01:17:23.740
Get lost, Little Man!

01:17:25.040 --> 01:17:28.700
Baron... You better stop this now...

01:17:28.800 --> 01:17:32.620
You're wrong if you think you can always
take away people's friends from them...

01:17:33.760 --> 01:17:37.130
Right now... I'm his friend!!

01:17:41.310 --> 01:17:42.680
Friend...?

01:17:44.640 --> 01:17:45.970
This is funny!

01:17:46.060 --> 01:17:48.730
Straw Hat! Listen carefully!

01:17:49.270 --> 01:17:55.770
This man, who claims he's your friend was
the captain of a pirates that I destroyed!

01:17:55.860 --> 01:17:58.530
He cried his eyes out,
begging me to forgive him!

01:17:58.620 --> 01:18:02.030
He was pathetic,
trembling with fear of being alone!

01:18:02.120 --> 01:18:05.820
What are you going to do
with a miserable friend like that?!

01:18:29.060 --> 01:18:30.680
S-Straw Hat...

01:18:56.720 --> 01:18:58.750
I thought I told you...

01:18:58.840 --> 01:19:01.210
I won't let you hurt my friends!!

01:19:01.850 --> 01:19:03.090
Friends...?

01:19:04.680 --> 01:19:05.840
Chobihigé!

01:19:11.480 --> 01:19:12.640
Chobihigé!

01:19:12.860 --> 01:19:14.100
Chobihigé!

01:19:14.570 --> 01:19:16.060
H-Hey... Hurry!
Help Reindeer-san and the others!

01:19:18.200 --> 01:19:22.240
You guys! Hold on! I'll be right there!

01:20:00.240 --> 01:20:01.690
All right!!

01:20:01.780 --> 01:20:04.230
He saved Reindeer-san and his friends!

01:20:06.950 --> 01:20:08.230
-Why...?
-Huh?

01:20:09.540 --> 01:20:11.610
- The voices are coming from another place...
- What?!

01:20:27.850 --> 01:20:30.600
Then...Zoro and the others...
Where are they?!

01:20:40.950 --> 01:20:42.400
Here. Right here.

01:21:18.650 --> 01:21:19.680
Die.

01:21:33.750 --> 01:21:34.990
Straw Hat!

01:21:38.880 --> 01:21:44.250
The arrows represent the days I spent
alone since the night of that storm.

01:21:47.430 --> 01:21:51.710
The number of times I mourned for my
beloved friends that I suddenly lost.

01:22:08.580 --> 01:22:11.360
Now do you understand how I feel?

01:22:23.010 --> 01:22:24.330
Straw Hat...

01:22:25.380 --> 01:22:28.170
I-It's... over...

01:22:31.350 --> 01:22:32.720
Don't give up!

01:22:34.770 --> 01:22:37.050
Reindeer-san and the others are calling you!!

01:22:37.440 --> 01:22:41.260
They're shouting, “Luffy! Be strong!“

01:22:41.650 --> 01:22:44.770
So! So! Don't give up!

01:22:48.870 --> 01:22:51.770
Luffy...

01:22:52.040 --> 01:22:54.360
Luffy...

01:22:54.830 --> 01:22:57.360
Luffy...

01:22:57.460 --> 01:22:59.070
Luffy...

01:22:59.290 --> 01:23:02.050
Luffy...

01:23:03.170 --> 01:23:05.500
Luffy...

01:23:14.180 --> 01:23:15.210
...What?!

01:23:15.850 --> 01:23:18.260
Friends...My friends...

01:23:20.610 --> 01:23:24.390
My friends... Give them back...

01:23:25.990 --> 01:23:31.610
My friends...My friends... Give them back...

01:23:32.830 --> 01:23:33.900
Luffy...

01:23:34.910 --> 01:23:36.780
Yes! That's it!

01:23:37.250 --> 01:23:40.530
Daisy, can you really hear them?

01:23:40.670 --> 01:23:41.860
Daddy can't seem to...

01:23:44.880 --> 01:23:48.930
To tell you the truth,
I heard you and Reindeer-san talking

01:23:49.010 --> 01:23:52.790
behind that gravestone this afternoon.
- What?!

01:23:54.430 --> 01:23:59.580
I got my good hearing from Mommy.
I can hear even the smallest whisper.

01:24:00.600 --> 01:24:02.850
But I pretended not to know.

01:24:03.520 --> 01:24:08.730
Because you're always
trying so hard to impress us.

01:24:10.070 --> 01:24:11.190
Daisy...

01:24:11.490 --> 01:24:14.940
But I know that you're actually really strong!

01:24:28.590 --> 01:24:29.750
Of course.

01:24:32.180 --> 01:24:33.790
Daddy's strong.

01:24:37.220 --> 01:24:38.340
Daddy!

01:24:53.990 --> 01:24:55.020
Daddy!!

01:24:56.030 --> 01:24:57.110
Go! Daddy!

01:24:58.910 --> 01:25:01.030
Daddy!
Daddy shoot!

01:25:03.040 --> 01:25:04.200
Shoot!

01:25:15.430 --> 01:25:16.810
Lily!!

01:25:16.890 --> 01:25:19.590
No! Lily!

01:25:32.200 --> 01:25:36.440
Oh my God! I can't believe
they did this to you...

01:25:36.950 --> 01:25:40.740
Then... Muchigoro
and the others... My friends...!!

01:25:46.380 --> 01:25:48.080
I'll get you for this.

01:25:50.260 --> 01:25:52.120
Unforgivable!!

01:26:15.110 --> 01:26:19.270
Muchigoro! Kerojee! DJ! Kotetsu!

01:26:19.370 --> 01:26:22.990
Everyone! Don't go...!

01:26:23.370 --> 01:26:26.120
Don't leave me alone.

01:26:26.710 --> 01:26:31.040
Without you all, I'm... I'm...

01:26:31.130 --> 01:26:36.870
Sir Baron, I'm sorry you
had to be alone for such a long time.

01:26:36.970 --> 01:26:38.210
Kerojee...

01:26:38.550 --> 01:26:41.840
Thank you for thinking of us
for such a long time pu.

01:26:42.180 --> 01:26:43.560
I'm so happy pu-

01:26:43.640 --> 01:26:44.800
DJ...

01:26:45.140 --> 01:26:48.800
But you should have forgotten about us

01:26:48.900 --> 01:26:52.140
after we died that stormy night.

01:26:52.690 --> 01:26:55.980
Muchigoro...Why do you say that? I was...

01:26:56.070 --> 01:26:58.270
We wouldn't have minded.

01:26:58.570 --> 01:27:03.030
You should have found new friends.

01:27:03.160 --> 01:27:05.610
New... friends...?

01:27:06.210 --> 01:27:10.030
You know, like him...

01:27:11.630 --> 01:27:13.870
Straw Hat!

01:27:21.720 --> 01:27:23.670
I thought I was gonna die!

01:27:23.770 --> 01:27:25.760
- Straw Hat!
- Mm?

01:27:27.020 --> 01:27:28.430
Ah! He's alive!

01:27:28.560 --> 01:27:30.510
- Thank God!
- Thank God!

01:27:30.610 --> 01:27:32.430
Thank God!

01:27:34.570 --> 01:27:38.270
You guys! You're not hurt, are you?

01:27:38.360 --> 01:27:39.690
Ouch!!

01:27:39.780 --> 01:27:41.860
You should be more worried about yourself.

01:27:41.950 --> 01:27:44.700
It's a miracle that
you're still alive after all that.

01:27:46.120 --> 01:27:49.410
Brief, I couldn't have done it without you.

01:27:49.710 --> 01:27:52.990
Say what? That's supposed to be MY line.

01:27:53.090 --> 01:27:55.650
And... you over there too.

01:27:56.590 --> 01:27:57.620
M-Me? Oh... No...

01:27:58.840 --> 01:28:00.170
It was nothing...

01:28:00.260 --> 01:28:02.130
Oh yeah... Where are my friends?

01:28:02.220 --> 01:28:05.670
Reindeer-san!!

01:28:06.270 --> 01:28:07.510
Daisy!

01:28:08.310 --> 01:28:10.590
Chopper, you're a popular guy.

01:28:11.900 --> 01:28:13.680
I don't know why,
but I feel like I slept for a long time.

01:28:13.770 --> 01:28:16.390
So where are we?

01:28:17.610 --> 01:28:20.060
Hey, look! The sun's rising!

01:28:27.790 --> 01:28:30.110
It's so bright!

01:28:37.800 --> 01:28:39.040
Mm? Is that Luffy?

01:28:39.130 --> 01:28:40.400
Yeah, it is.

01:28:45.720 --> 01:28:48.050
Luffy! Luffy!

01:28:49.140 --> 01:28:51.260
What are you doing, sleeping here?

01:28:52.190 --> 01:28:55.100
Luffy! Hey, Luffy!

01:29:26.850 --> 01:29:29.920
<i><i>How many people? Amari ni mo</i></i>

01:29:26.850 --> 01:29:29.920
<i><i>How many people?</i></i>

01:29:30.060 --> 01:29:33.840
<i><i>Bokura wa moroi
kami ni sae\h\h\h\h\h</i></i>

01:29:30.060 --> 01:29:33.840
<i><i>We are so fragile</i></i>

01:29:34.060 --> 01:29:37.970
<i><i>Tachi-mukau
yuuki ga hoshii</i></i>

01:29:34.060 --> 01:29:37.970
<i><i>\h\hGive me a courage
to fight against Gods</i></i>

01:29:38.360 --> 01:29:41.520
<i><i>Ataerareta sadame nante</i></i>

01:29:38.360 --> 01:29:41.520
<i><i>If I only accept
a given destiny</i></i>

01:29:41.690 --> 01:29:43.940
<i><i>Taikutsu sugite</i></i>

01:29:41.690 --> 01:29:43.940
<i><i>I'll be bored to death</i></i>

01:29:44.110 --> 01:29:50.150
<i><i>Tadayotte, samayotte,
bokura wa yuku\h\h\h\h\h\h</i></i>

01:29:44.110 --> 01:29:50.150
<i><i>\h\hWe keep drifting,
roaming, and living</i></i>

01:29:51.830 --> 01:29:56.950
<i><i>Dareka ni\h\h\h\h\h
uchi-aketakute</i></i>

01:29:51.830 --> 01:29:56.950
<i><i>I just want to tell someone</i></i>

01:29:57.500 --> 01:30:02.080
<i><i>Akenai yoru nante</i></i>

01:29:57.500 --> 01:30:02.080
<i><i>There is no night</i></i>

01:30:02.670 --> 01:30:05.000
<i><i>Nai koto</i></i>

01:30:02.670 --> 01:30:05.000
<i><i>That won't end</i></i>

01:30:06.300 --> 01:30:11.800
<i><i>Otona ni naru made,
sono hi ga kuru made</i></i>

01:30:06.300 --> 01:30:11.800
<i><i>Until we grow up
Until the day comes</i></i>

01:30:12.100 --> 01:30:16.180
<i><i>Bokura wa\h\h\h\h\h\h
toomawari shiyou</i></i>

01:30:12.100 --> 01:30:16.180
<i><i>Let's take a detour for now</i></i>

01:30:17.900 --> 01:30:22.770
<i><i>Sekai no himitsu ga
kimi o matteiru\h\h\h\h\h</i></i>

01:30:17.900 --> 01:30:22.770
<i><i>Secrets of the world await you</i></i>

01:30:23.490 --> 01:30:27.480
<i><i>Saa, yume miru koro ima</i></i>

01:30:23.490 --> 01:30:27.480
<i><i>Don't forget to keep
having your dreams</i></i>

01:30:27.910 --> 01:30:30.860
<i><i>Sugitemo</i></i>

01:30:27.910 --> 01:30:30.860
<i><i>It's not too late</i></i>

01:30:52.930 --> 01:30:58.470
<i><i>Sora yo, umi yo, hoshi yo,
kaze yo, kumo yo\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h</i></i>

01:30:52.930 --> 01:30:58.470
<i><i>Oh, sky, ocean, stars,
\h\h\hwind, and clouds</i></i>

01:30:58.770 --> 01:31:04.190
<i><i>Chichi yo, haha yo,\h\h\h\h
tomo yo, kono daichi yo</i></i>

01:30:58.770 --> 01:31:04.190
<i><i>Oh, fathers, mothers,
\h\hfriends, and earth</i></i>

01:31:04.360 --> 01:31:10.190
<i><i>Boku wa mitai,\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
kono yo no nani mo kamo</i></i>

01:31:04.360 --> 01:31:10.190
<i><i>I want to see everything
\h\hexisting in this world</i></i>

01:31:10.280 --> 01:31:17.510
<i><i>Boku wa mitai,\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h
kono hoshi no subete o</i></i>

01:31:10.280 --> 01:31:17.510
<i><i>I want to see everything
\hexisting on this planet</i></i>
